    "title": "No clinician plan documented today",
    "message": "No assessment or plan was documented for this visit. Given pregnancy, recent ART initiation, rising creatinine, and the DTG–iron interaction risk, a documented plan addressing renal monitoring, drug timing counselling, and VL follow-up is essential. The patient's VL is well suppressed at 89 copies/mL and CD4 improved from 312 to 389, indicating good treatment response, but documentation gaps risk missed safety signals.",
